This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

It also bundles example datasets that are the work of others and are
distributed under their own terms. Those datasets are stand-alone data files:
they are aggregated with the distribution, are not linked with the gog4j code,
and do not change the Apache-2.0 licence of the code. The authoritative,
machine-readable record of the same information ships in
gog4j-data/src/main/resources/META-INF/gog4j/datasets.properties and is kept in
step with org.jtaccuino.gog.sampler.meta.SampleDataset by the build.

