gwas — GIANT consortium human height GWAS
  Licence: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC-BY-4.0)
  Sources: https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-022-05275-y
  Attribution: L. Yengo, S. Vedantam, E. Marouli, J. Sidorenko, E. Bartell,
