polar — Aggregated from mtcars (GPL-2.0-only) and diamonds (MIT)
  Licence: Mixed: GPL-2.0-only (mtcars) and MIT (diamonds)
  Note: cylinder counts are aggregated from mtcars; clarity/cut counts are
    aggregated from diamonds at load time. The derived counts inherit the
    licences of their sources.

mountain — Generated mountain surface (gog4j)
  Licence: Apache License 2.0
  Note: sampled from a two-peak height function over [-3, 3]² in
    MountainDatasets.java and covered by the project licence.

sphere — Generated sphere point cloud (gog4j)
  Licence: Apache License 2.0
  Note: sampled on a latitude/longitude grid in SpherePointsDatasets.java and
    covered by the project licence.

synthetic — Synthetic frame generated in-code (gog4j)
  Licence: Apache License 2.0
  Note: built inline by the example factories and covered by the project
    licence.
